00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.941
Here's a quick history of him in the comics.

00:02:54.941 --> 00:03:00.900
The Vision was created by Ultron using the
remains of the Original Human Torch android.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:05.410
I know everyone thinks of Johnny Storm as
the Human Torch, but before him, an android

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:10.570
named Jim Hammond used the mantle during world
war 2 to fight Hitler and the Axis powers.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:15.140
That version of the character is actually
one of Marvel's very first superheroes.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:19.170
Ultron reprogrammed the android to fight the
Avengers, that first happened in the late

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:20.180
60s.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:24.019
Ultron programmed Vision with the neural patterns
of Wonder Man so that he could infiltrate

00:03:24.019 --> 00:03:25.019
the Avengers.

00:03:25.019 --> 00:03:29.150
Ultron also embedded a failsafe device called
a control crystal in him.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.150
Like an override switch.

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:33.500
He got his name "Vision" when the Janet Van
Dyne Wasp saw him for the first time when

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.319
Ultron trapped them revealing Visions true
form.

00:03:35.319 --> 00:03:40.879
Wasp called him an "unearthly, inhuman Vision".

00:03:40.879 --> 00:03:45.050
So already you can see some changes will be
made to the origin story in the movies because

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.980
we have no Wasp on the team yet.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:50.330
Vision ended up sympathizing with the Avengers
and helped them defeat Ultron.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.970
I feel like some of the details of the character
everyone knows, like he ended up getting married

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:56.040
to Scarlet Witch.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:00.349
Eventually that failsafe device Ultron embedded
in him malfunctioned and he went nuts trying

00:04:00.349 --> 00:04:01.620
to make the world perfect.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:05.830
He fixed the problem, but the military deemed
him a huge security threat.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:13.420
When Scarlet Witch lost her mind and set off
the whole no more mutants house of M storyline,

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.459
